# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */

/* Nested and explicit selectors with the same resolved target are compared. */
a b:hover {}
b {
  &:hover {}
}

/* A nested selector expanded through a parent selector list is reported once. */
.high .target {
  #theme &:hover {}
}
.low-a.one .target,
.low-b.two .target,
.low-c.three .target {
  &:hover {}
}

/* Combinators inside functional pseudo-classes do not split the target compound. */
.parent .target:has(.x > .y) {}
.target:has(.x > .y) {}

```

